    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειό-βᾰτος</span></b> , ὁ, a
		fish, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skate</i> or
			<i>ray</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				137
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				566a32
			</span></i>; another name for the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίνη</span>
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.312b
			</span></i>: but distd. from the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίνη</span>
			by <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ὁμαλὸς τόπος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεώβατος</span>.</div>
